          "content": {
            "size": 9602,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "[{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"active\":[{\"id\":\"7951625e-9714-42be-b6c6-699474bd7ae6\",\"title\":\"Marcus, the Reforming Soda Junkie\",\"payload\":{\"cohort_id\":\"AUD_01_NOSTALGIC_SODA_LOVER\",\"cohort_name\":\"The Nostalgic Soda Craver\",\"persona_tagged_name\":\"Marcus, the Reforming Soda Junkie\",\"demographic_anchor\":\"Age 28-42, millennial professional, loves snack culture but trying to stay fit\",\"core_motivation\":\"I want the exact fizzy, sweet comfort of the grape soda I drank as a kid, but without the 150 calories of high-fructose corn syrup and the inevitable sugar crash.\",\"use_case\":\"A guilt-free afternoon desk treat to get through the 3 PM workday slump without ruining his diet.\",\"triggering_event\":\"Staring at the office vending machine in the middle of a stressful afternoon, desperately wanting a sweet fizzy soda but walking away empty-handed because of the massive sugar guilt.\",\"jobs_to_be_done\":{\"functional\":\"Provide a sweet, heavily carbonated grape-flavored beverage with minimal sugar and calories.\",\"emotional\":\"Indulge in a comforting, retro treat that evokes childhood happiness without feeling guilty about health choices.\",\"social_identity\":\"Show colleagues that he can manage his fitness goals and stay healthy without boring himself with plain water.\"},\"schwartz_psychology\":{\"awareness_stage\":\"Product Aware\",\"awareness_description\":\"He knows prebiotic sodas exist and has seen OLIPOP, but he hasn't committed to trying the Classic Grape flavor yet because he's skeptical of healthy grape flavor profiles.\",\"market_sophistication\":\"Level 3\",\"sophistication_description\":\"He has tried sugar-free diet sodas with chemical aftertastes (like aspartame) and unsweetened sparkling waters that taste like absolutely nothing, leaving him deeply unsatisfied.\",\"required_unique_mechanism\":\"Real Concord grape juice concentrate blended with a tiny splash of lime and natural stevia leaf to replicate a authentic retro grape soda sweetness with only 5g of total sugar.\"},\"resistance_and_friction\":{\"internal_objection\":\"This won't work for me because healthy alternatives to grape flavor always taste medicinal or watery.\",\"external_objection\":\"This is way too expensive for a soda when I can buy a 12-pack of generic brand soda for the price of two of these cans.\",\"partner_objection\":\"My spouse will tell me we don't need to spend our grocery budget on premium soda when we already have sparkling water at home.\",\"switching_cost\":\"Breaking the cheap, low-effort habit of grabbing regular sodas from the office pantry or local convenience store.\"},\"lexicon_and_vocabulary\":{\"words_to_use\":[\"retro flavor\",\"classic sweet-tart\",\"concord grape\",\"all grown up\",\"nostalgia\",\"guilt-free carbonation\"],\"taboo_words\":[\"diet food\",\"artificial sweetener\",\"aspartame\",\"watery\",\"sacrifice\",\"medicinal\"]},\"audience_size\":{\"reach_tier\":\"broad\",\"audience_share\":45,\"sizing_rationale\":\"Millennials and Gen Z consumers who want to cut back on conventional soft drinks but still seek comfort foods make up the largest target market for healthy soda alternatives.\"}},\"source\":\"generated\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:10.614Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:18.015Z\"},{\"id\":\"e63fcaf2-27e8-4b88-8a7c-56e63c19cbcc\",\"title\":\"Chloe, the IBS Warrior\",\"payload\":{\"cohort_id\":\"AUD_02_GUT_HEALTH_OPTIMIZER\",\"cohort_name\":\"The Bloat-Free Soda Fan\",\"persona_tagged_name\":\"Chloe, the IBS Warrior\",\"demographic_anchor\":\"Age 23-35, active wellness enthusiast, actively researches gut-health hacks, suffers from chronic bloating\",\"core_motivation\":\"I miss carbonated drinks so much, but standard carbonation and artificial sugars destroy my stomach. I need something bubbly that actually feels good on my digestive system.\",\"use_case\":\"A digestive-boosting accompaniment to her daily lunch or dinner to prevent post-meal bloating.\",\"triggering_event\":\"Experiencing sharp stomach pain and major bloating after drinking a conventional sugar-free soda during lunch, which ruined the rest of her afternoon.\",\"jobs_to_be_done\":{\"functional\":\"Deliver active dietary fiber and gut-supporting prebiotics in a delicious, easy-to-drink canned format.\",\"emotional\":\"Feel relieved, energized, and clean inside rather than weighed down and bloated after having a fizzy beverage.\",\"social_identity\":\"Be recognized by friends and wellness communities as someone who stays ahead of health trends with high-quality functional foods.\"},\"schwartz_psychology\":{\"awareness_stage\":\"Solution Aware\",\"awareness_description\":\"She knows she needs prebiotics and fiber to soothe her stomach, but she doesn't realize she can get them through an actual delicious grape soda instead of boring powders.\",\"market_sophistication\":\"Level 4\",\"sophistication_description\":\"She has tried expensive apple cider vinegar drinks, chalky fiber powders, probiotic supplements, and sour kombuchas, but hates the harsh tastes and wants a clean, simple treat.\",\"required_unique_mechanism\":\"The OLISMART blend of nine diverse plant fibers, including marshmallow root and chicory root inulin, which actively feeds gut microbiomes while maintaining a smooth soda texture.\"},\"resistance_and_friction\":{\"internal_objection\":\"This won't work for me because carbonated canned drinks usually irritate my stomach lining regardless of what's in them.\",\"external_objection\":\"This is probably just a marketing trend; they probably added a tiny speck of fiber and labeled it as a gut health product.\",\"partner_objection\":\"My roommate will drink them all without realizing they are my expensive gut-health remedies.\",\"switching_cost\":\"Replacing her routine of buying premium functional kombuchas or mixing messy fiber prebiotic powders into her morning water.\"},\"lexicon_and_vocabulary\":{\"words_to_use\":[\"prebiotics\",\"digestive health\",\"9g of plant fiber\",\"gut friendly\",\"no bloat\",\"clean ingredients\"],\"taboo_words\":[\"empty calories\",\"syrup\",\"chemical\",\"bloating\",\"sugar bomb\",\"artificial\"]},\"audience_size\":{\"reach_tier\":\"focused\",\"audience_share\":35,\"sizing_rationale\":\"A substantial and fast-growing segment of health-conscious buyers seeking digestive solutions but refusing to compromise on taste.\"}},\"source\":\"generated\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:10.614Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:18.638Z\"},{\"id\":\"0d50aed6-a711-4541-823c-9fa71ae68cf2\",\"title\":\"Sarah, the Low-Sugar Mom\",\"payload\":{\"cohort_id\":\"AUD_03_HEALTHY_HOUSEHOLD_PARENT\",\"cohort_name\":\"The Conscious Family Gatekeeper\",\"persona_tagged_name\":\"Sarah, the Low-Sugar Mom\",\"demographic_anchor\":\"Age 32-45, parent of school-aged children, manages the household shopping list and meal planning\",\"core_motivation\":\"I want my kids to enjoy the fun of drinking a sweet purple soda during family dinners without loading them up with synthetic food dyes and heaps of refined sugar that make them hyperactive.\",\"use_case\":\"A special, kid-approved treat for weekend movie nights, backyard barbecues, or birthday parties.\",\"triggering_event\":\"Checking the nutrition facts label of a standard grape soda in the grocery store aisle and feeling horrified by the 39 grams of sugar and synthetic artificial colors.\",\"jobs_to_be_done\":{\"functional\":\"Provide a healthy, low-sugar, kid-friendly grape soda alternative with clean ingredients and no artificial food coloring.\",\"emotional\":\"Feel proud and peaceful knowing she is serving her children something that is actually nutritious and still exciting to them.\",\"social_identity\":\"Be viewed as a smart, modern parent who keeps her kids healthy without making them feel left out of fun treats.\"},\"schwartz_psychology\":{\"awareness_stage\":\"Problem Aware\",\"awareness_description\":\"She knows sugar and food dyes are harmful to her children's behavior and physical health, but she struggles to find healthy alternatives that kids won't reject.\",\"market_sophistication\":\"Level 2\",\"sophistication_description\":\"She has tried watered-down juices and sugar-free juice pouches, but her kids complain they taste watered down and constantly beg for real soda instead.\",\"required_unique_mechanism\":\"Real Concord grape juice concentrate provides a natural purple color and sweet-tart flavor profile that tastes like genuine soda, satisfying kids' sweet tooths with only 1g of added sugar.\"},\"resistance_and_friction\":{\"internal_objection\":\"This won't work because my kids are incredibly picky and will instantly taste the difference and refuse to drink it.\",\"external_objection\":\"I don't want to buy an expensive pack of soda only for it to sit in the pantry because the kids hate it.\",\"partner_objection\":\"My husband thinks kids should just drink tap water and that buying specialty premium sodas is a waste of money.\",\"switching_cost\":\"Moving away from the cheap, bulk-pack soda options at big-box grocery stores and introducing a new premium brand to the family pantry.\"},\"lexicon_and_vocabulary\":{\"words_to_use\":[\"real grape juice\",\"no artificial dyes\",\"kid approved\",\"family favorite\",\"only 1g added sugar\",\"guilt-free treat\"],\"taboo_words\":[\"boring water\",\"high fructose corn syrup\",\"artificial color\",\"red 40\",\"chemical sweetener\"]},\"audience_size\":{\"reach_tier\":\"niche\",\"audience_share\":20,\"sizing_rationale\":\"A highly targeted, high-value demographic of health-conscious parents willing to pay a premium to protect their family's health.\"}},\"source\":\"generated\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:10.614Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:19.249Z\"}],\"recommended\":[],\"recommendationGeneration\":{\"status\":\"ready\",\"triggerRunId\":\"run_06g0vq0n5np2otji0nrbtlkf01\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:27:44.053Z\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:12.659Z\",\"error\":null}}}}]"
