ava Root Fiber, Chicory Root Inulin, Jerusalem Artichoke Inulin, Nopal Cactus*, Marshmallow Root*, Calendula Flower*, Kudzu Root*)\",\"Concord Grape Juice Concentrate\",\"Cassava Root Syrup\",\"Apple Juice Concentrate\",\"Tartaric Acid (From Grapes)\",\"Quince Juice Concentrate\",\"Lime Juice Concentrate\",\"Stevia Leaf*\",\"Himalayan Pink Salt\",\"Natural Flavors\"],\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:beverage:soda\",\"totalSugars\":\"5g\",\"dietaryFiber\":\"9g\",\"purchaseType\":\"One Time\",\"variantLabel\":\"12 Pack - One Time\",\"dietaryClaims\":[\"Vegan\",\"Gluten Free\",\"Non-GMO\",\"Less Sugar\",\"Digestive Health Support\"],\"nutritionFacts\":\"1 Can (355mL)\",\"variantSummary\":{\"count\":2,\"attributes\":{\"purchaseType\":[\"One Time\",\"Subscription\"]}},\"totalCarbohydrate\":\"16g\",\"variantAttributes\":{\"purchaseType\":\"One Time\"},\"nutritionFacts heat\":null,\"storageInstructions\":\"Keep refrigerated\"},\"normalizedSummary\":{},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:03.936Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:19.739Z\"},{\"id\":\"8e4518ad-cf63-4b7c-91c7-db7e7b0e9081\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"976010ab-a63a-42a0-9e74-a69350a241d3\",\"parentOfferingId\":\"fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8\",\"offeringType\":\"variant\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"OLIPOP Classic Grape - 12 Pack - Subscribe & Save\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product-4-purchasetype-subscription\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://drinkolipop.com/products/classic-grape\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":null,\"imageIngestionStatus\":null,\"visualDescriptionStatus\":null,\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":null,\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":null,\"variantKey\":\"purchaseType=Subscription\",\"variantAttributes\":{\"purchaseType\":\"Subscription\"},\"position\":1,\"productTruth\":{\"name\":\"OLIPOP Classic Grape - 12 Pack - Subscribe & Save\",\"brand\":\"OLIPOP\",\"label\":\"12 Pack - Subscribe & Sa