rchaseType\":\"Subscription\",\"variantLabel\":\"12 Pack - Subscribe & Save\",\"dietaryClaims\":[\"Vegan\",\"Gluten Free\",\"Non-GMO\",\"Less Sugar\",\"Digestive Health Support\"],\"nutritionFacts\":\"1 Can (355mL)\",\"variantSummary\":{\"count\":2,\"attributes\":{\"purchaseType\":[\"One Time\",\"Subscription\"]}},\"totalCarbohydrate\":\"16g\",\"variantAttributes\":{\"purchaseType\":\"Subscription\"},\"nutritionFacts heat\":null,\"storageInstructions\":\"Keep refrigerated\"},\"normalizedSummary\":{},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:03.936Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:19.739Z\"}],\"isVariant\":false,\"variantCount\":2,\"generatedCreativeCount\":0,\"hasGeneratedCreatives\":false}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"976010ab-a63a-42a0-9e74-a69350a241d3\",\"parentOfferingId\":null,\"offeringType\":\"product\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"OLIPOP Classic Grape\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product-4\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://drinkolipop.com/products/classic-grape\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0vprb5g6p16mpfdq34qqu01\",\"imageIngestionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0vq375b3uhnje8te5b16e01\",\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":\"f6i4wm\",\"variantKey\":null,\"variantAttributes\":{},\"position\":0,\"productTruth\":{\"brand\":\"OLIPOP\",\"flavor\":\"Classic Grape\",\"images\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261142-5e249136-b15e-4ab1-9afd-e35badfee29d.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261170-1475e9c2-6eb6-4f93-8c91-af15cd43f6b7.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261125-fbea94b8-6dae-4bd1-bfdc-3cc997ac0087.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261044-63854194-4bb4-4832-9d59-2885c610a445.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261155-3a07674d-3e62-42a1-a762-e9e180988ed6.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261187-fc65f001-76ae-4632-b96e-5941a66fc459.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261195-22140ea6-c19f-4d0e-8747-e6efc0deca32.png\"],\"sodium\":\"30mg\",\"protein\":\"0g\",\"calories\":50,\"totalFat\":\"0g\",\"addedSugars\":\"1g\",\"description\":\"Sweet-tart concord grape juice, kissed with lime. Made from real concord grape juice with a hint of lime to create the perfect blend of sweet and tart, our Classic Grape is the nostalgic flavor you know and love—all grown up.\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"ingredients\":[\"Carbonated Water\",\"OLISMART (Cassava Root Fiber, Chicory Root Inulin, Jerusalem Artichoke Inulin, Nopal Cactus*, Marshmallow Root*, Calendula Flower*, Kudzu Root*)\",\"Concord Grape Juice Concentrate\",\"Cassava Root Syrup\",\"Apple Juice Concentrate\",\"Tartaric Acid (From Grapes)\",\"Quince Juice Concentrate\",\"Lime Juice Concentrate\",\"Stevia Leaf*\",\"Himalayan Pink Salt\",\"Natural Flavors\"],\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:beverage:soda\",\"totalSugars\":\"5g\",\"dietaryFiber\":\"9g\",\"dietaryClaims\":[\"Vegan\",\"Gluten Free\",\"Non-GMO\",\"Less Sugar\",\"Digestive Health Support\"],\"nutritionFacts\":\"1 Can (355mL)\",\"variantSummary\":{\"count\":2,\"attributes\":{\"purchaseType\":[\"One Time\",\"Subscription\"]}},\"buying_archetypes\":{\"primaryArchetype\":{\"name\":\"Upgrade / Optimization\",\"reason\":\"This product is positioned as a modern, high-quality upgrade to traditional grape soda, offering a premium and healthier alternative without sacrificing nostalgic flavor.\"},\"secondaryArchetypes\":[{\"name\":\"Problem Solver\",\"reason\":\"With 9g of dietary fiber and low sugar, it solves the functional health and digestive issues associated with traditional high-sugar sodas.\"},{\"name\":\"Routine / Replenishment\",\"reason\":\"As a daily beverage option with subscription availability, it fits seamlessly into a recurring household grocery restock and daily refreshment routine.\"}]},\"totalCarbohydrate\":\"16g\",\"visual_description\":\"This 12 fl oz (355 mL) aluminum beverage can features a cylindrical silhouette with a silver metallic top rim, a standard silver pull tab, and a silver bottom rim. The primary version of the can has a matte, pastel lavender-lilac finish, adorned on the front with the brand name OLIPOP arched across the upper third in bold, deep violet-purple uppercase letters. Centered below the brand name is a graphic of a stylized grape cluster composed of thirteen solid violet-purple circles, crowned by a single curved, dark forest-green leaf and stem pointing left. Beneath this graphic, the flavor name Classic Grape is written in a dark forest-green serif typeface across two lines. Further down, the tagline A New Kind of Soda is printed in a smaller violet-purple sans-serif font, with the volume 12 fl oz (355 mL) centered at the bottom. The upper shoulder of the can features the phrase Supports Digestive Health in small dark forest-green sans-serif text. Flanking the central graphics on the left are the words Prebiotics, Botanicals, and Plant Fiber, with Non GMO at the bottom left; the right side features a small circular Plant Powered Microbiome Approved seal and the callout 5g of sugar per can at the bottom right. A secondary version of the product is also visible, which reverses the colorway to feature a deep royal-purple can body with white lettering for the brand name, flavor, and side text, while the grape graphic is highlighted with lighter lavender tones.\",\"nutritionFacts heat\":null,\"storageInstructions\":\"Keep refrigerated\"},\"normalizedSummary\":{\"summary\":\"A prebiotic soda that gives classic grape flavor a modern upgrade, made with real concord grape juice, a hint of lime, and 9g of dietary fiber.\"},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:26:59.440Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:19.734Z\",\"variantCount\":2,\"creativeCount\":0,\"generatedCreativeCount\":0,\"hasGeneratedCreatives\":false},{\"id\":\"6ff58a5f-f626-4006-94f2-50ef9146b4c1\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"78371df6-ec93-4a25-abd7-c7eaeff1f406\",\"parentOfferingId\":null,\"offeringType\":\"product\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"SNIQUE Bakuchi Matte Hydrator Moisturizer\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product-3\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://snique.in/products/bakuchi-matte-hydrator-moisturizer\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0d66c6le15s0aecim2p4h01\",\"imageIngestionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0d6mdaqnd2jc8vsu319am01\",\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":\"1mih5ml\",\"variantKey\":null,\"variantAttributes\":{},\"position\":0,\"productTruth\":{\"brand\":\"SNIQUE\",\"price\":\"Rs. 299.00\",\"images\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6ff58a5f-f626-4006-94f2-50ef9146b4c1/1786817107038-d935f726-a8cf-41f6-a859-ab4a7cb93726.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6ff58a5f-f626-4006-94f2-50ef9146b4c1/1786817106979-65b221af-02a0-44a3-9c5d-20a042a8be8b.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6ff58a5f-f626-4006-94f2-50ef9146b4c1/1786817107028-79453fe4-9e1b-4fb0-9f73-badb5f69ca8d.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6ff58a5f-f626-4006-94f2-50ef9146b4c1/1786817107296-786ccf2e-53bb-4db0-8678-42041a57ce9e.png\"],\"caution\":\"For external use only. Avoid contact with the eyes. Patch test recommended. Discontinue if irritation occurs. Keep out of children’s reach.\",\"storage\":\"Store in a cool & dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight.\",\"howToUse\":\"Apply evenly on cleansed face & neck. Use morning and night. For daytime, follow with sunscreen.\",\"description\":\"Snique Matt Moisturizer is a lightweight, oil-free hydrating gel-cream designed for oily, combination, and acne-prone skin. Powered by Ceramide Complex + Hyaluronic Acid, it restores the skin barrier and locks in moisture without shine. The botanical blend of Cica, Ginseng, Ice Apple, Butterfly Pea Extract & Berry Complex soothes, repairs, and brightens the skin. Bakuchiol, a gentle retinol alternative, helps refine texture and improve clarity, while SEPIMAT™ H10 FW provides a soft-focus matte effect for all-day freshness.\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"ingredients\":[\"Aqua (Water)\",\"Ceramide Complex (Ceramide NP, Ceramide AP, Ceramide EOP)\",\"Xylitol\",\"Betaine\",\"Sodium Hyaluronate\",\"Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride\",\"Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract\",\"Centella Asiatica Extract\",\"Panax Ginseng Root Extract\",\"Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/Beheneth-25 Methacrylate Crosspolymer (Aristoflex® Silk)\",\"Methyl Methacrylate Crosspolymer (SEPIMAT™ H10 FW)\",\"Phenoxyethanol\",\"Ethylhexylglycerin\",\"Menthyl Lactate\",\"Ice Apple Extract (Borassus Flabellifer)\",\"Inositol\",\"Bakuchiol\",\"Clitoria Ternatea (Butterfly Pea) Flower Extract\",\"Vaccinium spp. Berry Extract Complex\",\"Rosa Canina (Rosehip) Oil\"],\"keyBenefits\":[\"Long-lasting matte finish\",\"Controls excess oil & shine\",\"Deep hydration without greasiness\",\"Strengthens skin barrier with ceramides\",\"Soothes redness and irritation\",\"Refines texture & supports anti-aging\",\"Non-comedogenic gel-cream formula\"],\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:skincare:moisturizer\",\"buying_archetypes\":{\"primaryArchetype\":{\"name\":\"Problem Solver\",\"reason\":\"This moisturizer specifically targets frustrating skin concerns like excess oil, greasy shine, and acne-prone breakouts with a lightweight, non-comedogenic formula that provides a long-lasting matte finish.\"},\"secondaryArchetypes\":[{\"name\":\"Routine / Replenishment\",\"reason\":\"Designed for essential daily use both morning and night, this product fits naturally into a consumer's recurring skincare habit.\"},{\"name\":\"Upgrade / Optimization\",\"reason\":\"The inclusion of advanced ingredients like a Ceramide Complex and a gentle retinol alternative (Bakuchiol) appeals to users looking to optimize their basic moisturizer for better barrier repair and texture refinement.\"}]},\"visual_description\":\"This skin care product set consists of a 50-gram moisturizer in a cylindrical jar and its corresponding square paperboard carton. The jar features a thick-walled, frosted, semi-translucent pale-blue body—likely made of glass or heavy plastic—topped with a flush-fitting, opaque, matte white cylindrical screw cap. A white adhesive label on the front of the jar displays the text \\\"Bakuchi Matte\\\" over \\\"Hydrator Moisturizer\\\" in a bold, dark gray sans-serif font, underlined by a thin light-blue line, with a left-aligned list of six product benefits and \\\"NET QTY.: 50 gm\\\" at the bottom right. The brand name \\\"sniQue\\\" is printed vertically along the label's right edge in a light-blue stylized typeface. The matching matte-finish outer carton is primarily white with a contrasting solid light-blue band wrapping around the bottom fifth of the box. The front of the carton replicates the jar's typography and vertical brand logo, but adds a horizontal, rounded light-blue capsule printed with \\\"Ceramides + Hyaluronic Acid + Bakuchiol\\\" positioned within the bottom band. The carton's side panels present lists of ingredients, directions, and warnings in dark gray text under light-blue headers, maintaining the clean, two-tone layout.\"},\"normalizedSummary\":{\"summary\":\"A lightweight, oil-free hydrating gel-cream designed for oily, combination, and acne-prone skin, providing a long-lasting matte finish and restoring the skin barrier.\"},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T18:04:31.192Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T18:07:42.556Z\",\"variantCount\":0,\"creativeCount\":6,\"generatedCreativeCount\":6,\"hasGeneratedCreatives\":true},{\"id\":\"40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"78371df6-ec93-4a25-abd7-c7eaeff1f406\",\"parentOfferingId\":null,\"offeringType\":\"product\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"SNIQUE Anti Acne Foaming Facewash\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product-2\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://snique.in/products/anti-acne-foaming-facewash\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0d410lvl8ehm81tis3k8f01\",\"imageIngestionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0d46e3d2j2bj3qemdum1o01\",\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":\"1x6799z\",\"variantKey\":null,\"variantAttributes\":{},\"position\":0,\"productTruth\":{\"brand\":\"SNIQUE\",\"images\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535495-cf3f9bf0-19ca-4cf6-90f7-f88ce9cdf577.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535537-5b7b72b0-f72e-4fd4-8dc7-55e167fe9ce1.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535471-6193e147-13dc-41cf-b09d-e1f79cb77943.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/40a78158-009e-4be2-ba8d-2ef357f1fd04/1786816535650-1801c00f-aab6-4107-a16c-a53252d8577b.png\"],\"rating\":4.7,\"caution\":[\"For external use only.\",\"Avoid eye contact; rinse immediately if it occurs.\",\"Do a patch test before first use.\",\"Discontinue if irritation persists.\",\"Keep out of reach of children.\"],\"storage\":\"Store in a cool and dry place. Protect from direct sunlight and heat.\",\"howToUse\":[\"Pump 1–2 times to dispense soft foam.\",\"Massage gently over the damp face in circular motions.\",\"Rinse thoroughly.\",\"Use twice daily.\"],\"salePrice\":\"Rs. 299.00\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"ingredients\":\"Aqua (Water), Coco Amido Propyl Betaine, Sodium Cocoyl Methyl Taurate, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Salicylic Acid, Succinic Acid, VeryBerry™ ACNEcare (Water (and) Propanediol (and) Salicylic Acid (and) Sodium Hydroxide (and) Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate (and) Citrus Junos Seed Extract (and) Citrus Unshiu Peel Extract (and) Actinidia Chinensis (Kiwi) Seed Extract (and) Fragaria Chiloensis (Strawberry) Fruit Extract (and) Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Leaf Extract (and) Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Skin Extract (and) Garcinia Mangostana Peel Extract), Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin.\",\"keyBenefits\":[\"Ultra-gentle microfoam cleanses deeply\",\"Removes excess oil & unclogs pores\",\"Helps reduce acne, blackheads & breakouts\",\"Calms redness with soothing botanicals\",\"Suitable for oily, acne-prone & sensitive skin\",\"Non-stripping, pH-balanced formula\"],\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:skincare:facewash\",\"regularPrice\":\"Rs. 599.00\",\"reviewsCount\":3,\"activeComplex\":[\"Salicylic Acid (BHA) - Removes dead skin & clears pores\",\"Succinic Acid - Targets acne-causing bacteria & sebum\",\"VeryBerry™ ACNEcare - Multi-fruit anti-acne complex (Kiwi, Strawberry, Grape, Mangosteen, Yuzu)\",\"Allantoin - Soothes & reduces irritation\"],\"buying_archetypes\":{\"primaryArchetype\":{\"name\":\"Problem Solver\",\"reason\":\"The product is formulated specifically to target active skin issues, including acne breakouts, excess oil production, and redness, resolving a clear physiological frustration.\"},\"secondaryArchetypes\":[{\"name\":\"Routine / Replenishment\",\"reason\":\"As a daily foaming face wash meant to be used twice a day, this is a recurring consumable that integrates directly into a customer's morning and evening hygiene routine.\"},{\"name\":\"Upgrade / Optimization\",\"reason\":\"Formulated with specialized active ingredients like Succinic Acid and VeryBerry™ ACNEcare, it appeals to consumers looking to upgrade from basic cleansers to a more advanced, non-stripping skincare solution.\"}]},\"visual_description\":\"This skincare product set consists of a 150 mL cylindrical foaming face wash bottle and its matching tall, rectangular cardboard outer box, both featuring a clean, minimalist white-and-light-green color palette. The bottle is made of smooth white plastic, capped with a large white foaming pump dispenser nozzle and covered by a clear, translucent cylindrical plastic cap. The bottle's main body is wrapped in a matte white label with a solid light green band at the base, matching the graphics on the rectangular box. On the front of both the bottle and the box, the upper left side displays bold, black sans-serif text reading \\\"Anti-Acne\\\", \\\"Foam Face\\\", and \\\"Wash\\\", followed by the description \\\"Foam That Fights Acne – Gently & Effectively\\\" and a list of benefits (\\\"Clear Skin\\\", \\\"Zero Oil\\\", \\\"Gentle Foam Purity\\\") separated by a thin, horizontal green line. The brand name \\\"sniQue\\\" is printed vertically on the right in a large, stylized, rounded light green lowercase font. At the very bottom, set inside the light green band, a rounded-corner rectangular block contains the text \\\"Salicylic Acid (BHA) + Succinic Acid + Multi-fruit anti-acne complex + Allantoin\\\" in small black sans-serif font. The side panels of the box and back of the bottle display detailed product information, featuring light green section headers such as \\\"Ingredients\\\", \\\"Directions For Use\\\", and \\\"Warnings\\\" followed by dense black text detailing chemical and botanical components, application steps, and safety precautions.\"},\"normalizedSummary\":{\"summary\":\"An ultra-gentle microfoam cleanser formulated with Salicylic Acid and Succinic Acid to fight acne, remove excess oil, and soothe redness without stripping the skin.\"},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:55:03.104Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:56:14.292Z\",\"variantCount\":0,\"creativeCount\":3,\"generatedCreativeCount\":3,\"hasGeneratedCreatives\":true},{\"id\":\"87972c9f-a792-4e87-ad2f-fb2f744ba4bb\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"78371df6-ec93-4a25-abd7-c7eaeff1f406\",\"parentOfferingId\":null,\"offeringType\":\"product\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"SNIQUE Glitter Spray Sunscreen SPF 30+++\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://snique.in/products/glitter-spray-sunscreen-spf-30\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0d316egrbijqdve3kt6tp01\",\"imageIngestionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0d36v1bb27merjauag5j501\",\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":\"u0h028\",\"variantKey\":null,\"variantAttributes\":{},\"position\":0,\"productTruth\":{\"spf\":\"30+++\",\"brand\":\"SNIQUE\",\"claims\":[\"Broad Spectrum Protection\",\"Cosmetic-Grade Glitter\",\"Cruelty-Free\",\"Reef-Safe Formula\",\"Hydrating & Non-Greasy\",\"Dermatologist Tested\"],\"finish\":\"Lightweight, Hydrating, Shimmer Finish\",\"images\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/87972c9f-a792-4e87-ad2f-fb2f744ba4bb/1786816273628-82242918-02fb-40e5-9c8c-4dbbd57f8581.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/87972c9f-a792-4e87-ad2f-fb2f744ba4bb/1786816273748-d5a6d055-125e-49ef-8735-bc623d393d21.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/87972c9f-a792-4e87-ad2f-fb2f744ba4bb/1786816273516-8c97ad3e-5b40-45eb-9f42-480a7eb79d21.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/87972c9f-a792-4e87-ad2f-fb2f744ba4bb/1786816273707-097794c3-ed21-42ee-bc02-b5a2ac53ff37.png\"],\"cautions\":[\"For external use only. Avoid contact with the eyes.\",\"Patch test recommended. If irritation occurs, discontinue use.\",\"Keep out of reach of children. Flammable – do not use near heat or open flame.\"],\"howToUse\":\"Shake well before use. Spray generously and evenly 15 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply every 2 hours, after sweating or swimming. Avoid eyes and lips.\",\"subBrand\":\"COANC GlowGuard™\",\"basePrice\":\"Rs. 449.00\",\"netWeight\":\"100 mL / 3.38 fl oz\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"ingredients\":[\"Aqua (Water)\",\"Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate\",\"Homosalate\",\"Octocrylene\",\"Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane\",\"Glycerin\",\"Alcohol Denat.\",\"Hyaluronic Acid\",\"Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract\",\"Tocopheryl Acetate\",\"Panthenol\",\"Polysorbate 20\",\"Phenoxyethanol\",\"Ethylhexylglycerin\",\"Parfum (Fragrance)\",\"Mica\",\"Titanium Dioxide (for glitter effect)\",\"CI 77891\",\"CI 77491\"],\"keyBenefits\":[\"Broad Spectrum SPF 30+++ | Protects against UVA + UVB rays\",\"Hydrating Formula | With hyaluronic acid & glycerin for lasting moisture\",\"Micro-Shimmer Finish | Cosmetic-grade glitter adds a radiant glow\",\"Ultra-Light Mist | No stickiness, no residue, no white cast\",\"Water & Sweat Resistant | Up to 80 minutes of protection\"],\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:skincare:sunscreen\",\"sunscreenType\":\"Broad-Spectrum UVA/UVB Protection\",\"variantSummary\":{\"count\":1,\"attributes\":{\"spf\":[\"30+++\"],\"brand\":[\"SNIQUE\"],\"finish\":[\"Lightweight, Hydrating, Shimmer Finish\"],\"howToUse\":[\"Shake well before use. Spray generously and evenly 15 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply every 2 hours, after sweating or swimming. Avoid eyes and lips.\"],\"subBrand\":[\"COANC GlowGuard™\"],\"basePrice\":[\"Rs. 449.00\"],\"netWeight\":[\"100 mL / 3.38 fl oz\"],\"variantKey\":[\"100 mL / 3.38 fl oz\"],\"hasNSFWRisk\":[\"false\"],\"taxonomyTag\":[\"product:skincare:sunscreen\"],\"variantLabel\":[\"100 mL / 3.38 fl oz\"],\"sunscreenType\":[\"Broad-Spectrum UVA/UVB Protection\"],\"waterResistance\":[\"80 minutes\"]}},\"waterResistance\":\"80 minutes\",\"buying_archetypes\":{\"primaryArchetype\":{\"name\":\"Desire / Identity\",\"reason\":\"The inclusion of cosmetic-grade glitter for a micro-shimmer, radiant finish appeals heavily to consumers wanting to enhance their aesthetic appearance, signal style, and feel glowing and attractive.\"},\"secondaryArchetypes\":[{\"name\":\"Risk / Prevention\",\"reason\":\"Despite its cosmetic sparkle, the product serves as an SPF 30+++ broad-spectrum sunscreen protecting the user from harmful UV rays and sunburn.\"},{\"name\":\"Occasion / Event\",\"reason\":\"A glitter sunscreen is highly seasonal and occasion-driven, making it especially appealing for pool parties, beach trips, music festivals, and summer vacations.\"}]},\"visual_description\":\"This product consists of a 100 mL liquid sunscreen housed in a clear cylindrical plastic spray bottle, accompanied by a tall, rectangular cardboard carton. The bottle reveals a vibrant, iridescent coral-pink liquid suspended with fine, light-reflective micro-shimmer glitter, and is fitted with a white spray nozzle assembly under a clear, flush-fitting cylindrical plastic cap. White text is printed directly on the front of the bottle, displaying the product name \\\"Glitter Spray Sunscreen SPF 30+++\\\" above descriptive details (\\\"Hydrating Mist with Sparkle Protection\\\", \\\"Lightweight\\\", \\\"Hydrating\\\", \\\"Shimmer Finish\\\"), with \\\"NET QTY.: 100 ML\\\" positioned at the bottom right. The accompanying carton features a clean, two-toned color block design where the top three-quarters is matte white and the bottom quarter is a solid coral-pink block. A large, stylized, lowercase coral-pink brand logo spelling \\\"snique\\\" wraps around the corner, split vertically down the seam between the front and side panels. The front panel of the carton mirrors the bottle's layout in dark grey text on the white section, and includes a rounded-rectangle badge at the bottom containing \\\"Hyaluronic Acid + Aloe Vera + Vitamin E\\\". The carton's side and back panels display product details, ingredients, directions, and warnings in dark grey text under coral-pink headers on the white portion, with the bottom coral-pink block of one side featuring five white line-art symbols representing recycling, GMP, cruelty-free, 24M, and vegan certifications.\"},\"normalizedSummary\":{\"summary\":\"A multi-functional SPF 30+++ sunscreen mist that protects against UVA/UVB rays, hydrates with hyaluronic acid, and leaves a radiant shimmer finish.\"},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:50:42.412Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:52:14.540Z\",\"variantCount\":1,\"creativeCount\":3,\"generatedCreativeCount\":3,\"hasGeneratedCreatives\":true}]}},{\"result\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8\",\"name\":\"OLIPOP Classic Grape\",\"status\":\"active\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261142-5e249136-b15e-4ab1-9afd-e35badfee29d.webp\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:26:59.440Z\"}]}}]"
