ext, while the grape graphic is highlighted with lighter lavender tones.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261142-5e249136-b15e-4ab1-9afd-e35badfee29d.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261170-1475e9c2-6eb6-4f93-8c91-af15cd43f6b7.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261125-fbea94b8-6dae-4bd1-bfdc-3cc997ac0087.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261044-63854194-4bb4-4832-9d59-2885c610a445.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/976010ab-a63a-42a0-9e74-a69350a241d3/930cf6f7-42c1-4832-bcbd-35c9dd59618f.png\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261142-5e249136-b15e-4ab1-9afd-e35badfee29d.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261170-1475e9c2-6eb6-4f93-8c91-af15cd43f6b7.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261125-fbea94b8-6dae-4bd1-bfdc-3cc997ac0087.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261044-63854194-4bb4-4832-9d59-2885c610a445.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/976010ab-a63a-42a0-9e74-a69350a241d3/930cf6f7-42c1-4832-bcbd-35c9dd59618f.png\"]},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T13:28:40.193Z\"}]}],\"offeringKind\":\"physical\",\"offeringProductImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261142-5e249136-b15e-4ab1-9afd-e35badfee29d.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/fdfcaad1-1542-44ff-a267-cc38b91f44b8/1786973261170-1475e9c2-6eb6-4f93-8c91-af15cd43f6b7.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-